  "dct_description_sm": [
    "These datasets and maps show the number of IDP sites per woreda in the Somali region, using DTM Site Assessment Round 36 as a reference. These IDP sites include various settlement types: collective centers, dispersed settlements, host communities, planned camps, and spontaneous camps/sites. More detailed information can be found at the following link: https://dtm.iom.int/ethiopia#producttabs."
